function sosHelp($m){$h=[
'branding'=>['Introduce your school with its official identity.','Branding appears on your school dashboard and helps families recognise your school.','Use your registered school name, official colours and a clear PNG logo.'],
'campuses'=>['Register each physical school location.','Campuses help distinguish records when a school operates in multiple locations.','Begin with your main campus; add branches only when needed.'],
'levels'=>['Choose the education stages your school offers.','Levels organise classes, curricula and assessments.','Nursery, Primary, Junior Secondary and Senior Secondary are common starting points.'],
'curricula'=>['Record the curriculum followed by each level.','Curriculum choices influence subjects and assessment expectations.','Check the current NERDC and applicable state guidance before finalising.'],
'sessions'=>['Define the school academic year.','Sessions keep attendance, assessments and reporting in the right year.','Many schools use a September–July cycle; enter your actual approved dates.'],
'terms'=>['Divide the session into reporting periods.','Terms organise result publication, fees and school activities.','First, Second and Third Term are common in Nigerian schools; dates vary.'],
'classes'=>['Create classes and optional arms.','Class assignments drive student records, timetables and results.','Use names such as Primary 1, JSS 1 and SSS 1 with arms A/B as needed.'],
'subjects'=>['Define subjects offered by your school.','Subjects determine assessment and report-card entries.','Start with your approved curriculum subject list; do not assume all subjects apply to every level.'],
'calendars'=>['Record the important dates in your school year.','Families and staff need accurate dates for resumption, tests, exams and holidays.','Create term resumption, mid-term break, exams and vacation events after confirming dates.'],
'grading'=>['Define how marks become grades.','A consistent grading scheme helps teachers interpret results fairly.','Review the suggested editable score bands; your school policy takes priority.'],
'weights'=>['Set the contribution of tests and exams.','Weights determine how a final subject score is calculated.','40% continuous assessment and 60% examination is one common example, not a national mandate.'],
'promotion'=>['Describe when students progress to the next class.','Clear promotion policies reduce inconsistent decisions.','Have school leadership approve thresholds before applying them.'],
'reports'=>['Choose the format of termly reports.','Report templates communicate student performance to families.','Use developmental observations for nursery and subject-based reports for primary/secondary.'],
'fees'=>['Create reusable fee categories.','Templates make billing consistent across classes and terms.','Begin with tuition; add levies, transport or meals only if offered.'],
'permissions'=>['Define staff access.','Least-privilege access protects student and financial records.','Give each role only the permissions required for its work.'],
'admission'=>['Configure unique student admission numbers.','Consistent numbers make record searches and transfers easier.','Use a short school prefix plus year and sequence.'],
'policies'=>['Document school-specific operating rules.','Written policies help staff apply procedures consistently.','Start with policies approved by school management.']];return $h[$m]??['Configure this school setting.','This setting supports daily school operations.','Review it with your school administrator.'];}
